[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    101[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Behaviors that were already correct and are now pinned by tests
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    102[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    103[0m:[38;5;10m[49m These are the parts of the C that look like bugs but are the specification:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    104[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    105[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **`fgets` reads at most 127 bytes**, not a whole line. `char text[128]` with
