[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    112[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `nul_exactly_at_last_buffer_slot`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    113[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    114[0m:[38;5;10m[49m - **A 127-byte line plus its newline takes two `fgets` calls.** The first fills
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    115[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   the buffer without seeing `\n`; the newline is returned by the next call.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    116[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
