[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    118[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   but `fputs` writes a C string and stops at the first one. Input `abc\0def\n`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    119[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   echoes `abc` — the `def\n` is discarded, not echoed later. Input `\0\n` echoes
